      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 845: 🔴 **Transport-CC URI mismatch in SDP answers can break negotiation.** In answer mode, `addMediaDescription()` resolves the remote extmap ID from `-01/-02/-03` URIs, but always advertises `TRANSPORT_CC_RTP_EXTENSION_URI` (hardcoded `-01`). If the offer used `-02`/`-03`, a strict peer may reject or ignore transport-cc because the answer does not echo the negotiated URI. **Fix:** when `sdpDirection_ \u003d\u003d ANSWER`, persist which URI variant was found and emit that exact URI in `addExtmapAttribute()` (both bundled and non-bundled cases).",
